{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00889","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 有所思 · 刘氏云","name":"鼓吹曲辞 有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝亦有所思，暮亦有所思。\n登楼望君处，蔼蔼浮云飞。\n浮云遮却阳关道，向晚谁知妾怀抱。\n玉井苍苔春院深，桐花落地无人扫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘氏云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}